  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NI Greater Managua Water and Sanitation (PRASMA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project&apos;s Development Objective is to increase access to reliable* water and sanitation services to the population of the greater Managua region.   *Reliable water is defined as piped potable water with adequate pressure and continuity of at least 16 hours per day, 7 days per week.</narrative>
  </description>
